  "scope": "rad=theta*pi/180; r=a*(1+cos(rad)); px=r*cos(rad); py=r*sin(rad); area=0.5*a^2*(1.5*rad + 2*sin(rad) + 0.25*sin(2*rad)); full=1.5*pi*a^2",
